{"id": "62392", "title": "夜夜娇宠", "author": "重口味小七", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 6, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/62/62392.htm", "intro": "落地凤凰不如鸡，\r\n这句话在林娆身上发挥的淋漓尽致，\r\n昔日的市长千金，\r\n骄傲矜贵\r\n却在一场政治谋变中\r\n一无所有\r\n当叶墨城这个男人以救赎者的姿态\r\n出现在她生命里时候，\r\n注定了日后她的沉浮，\r\n到底是救赎，还是毁灭", "base": "files/article/html/62/62392", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "9257284.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "9257286.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "9257288.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "9257291.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "9257293.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "9257297.html", "available": false}]}